  <?php if($showSettings):?>
  <section class="vb-inbox-settings"><div class="dashboard-card vb-inbox-settings-card"><span class="eyebrow">Attention policy</span><h2>How Trip Inbox should surface work</h2><p>These settings govern in-app Trip Inbox, Command Center and agent-attention surfaces. Vacation Brain does not send email or push notifications from this feature.</p><form class="vb-inbox-settings-form" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="save_preferences"><input type="hidden" name="return_trip" value="<?=$tripId?>"><input type="hidden" name="return_filter" value="<?=e($filter)?>"><input type="hidden" name="return_settings" value="1"><label>Delivery mode<select class="input" name="delivery_mode"><option value="all" <?=$prefs['delivery_mode']==='all'?'selected':''?>>All in-app activity</option><option value="important_only" <?=$prefs['delivery_mode']==='important_only'?'selected':''?>>Important only outside the inbox</option><option value="daily_digest" <?=$prefs['delivery_mode']==='daily_digest'?'selected':''?>>Daily digest mode</option></select></label><label class="inline-check"><input type="checkbox" name="immediate_disruptions" value="1" <?=!empty($prefs['immediate_disruptions'])?'checked':''?>> <span>Surface urgent disruptions immediately even in digest mode.</span></label><label>Digest hour<select class="input" name="digest_hour"><?php foreach(range(0,23) as $h):?><option value="<?=$h?>" <?=(int)$prefs['digest_hour']===$h?'selected':''?>><?=date('g A',mktime($h,0))?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><button class="button primary small" type="submit">Save preferences</button></form></div><div class="dashboard-card vb-inbox-settings-card"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy boundary</span><h2>Normalized facts only</h2><div class="vb-inbox-privacy">Trip Inbox does not store raw Gmail bodies, OAuth tokens, confirmation codes, payment data, private booking notes, exact device coordinates, private Traveler Memory, or provider operational references. Resolve and Snooze change only inbox presentation state; they never approve, cancel, purchase, modify, dismiss or execute the underlying source action.</div></div></section>
